  "d.109szp9": "Ghaṭṭanāya thiraṃ bhūmitalaṃ vā nimmāṇāni vā.",
  "d.10azxrl": "Sūriyamaṇḍalassa pabhā-talato tayo sūriya-addhavyāsā upari. Chāyā jīvitaṃ: vedikāya āvaraṇaṃ, dhūmaketu, mahantā nāvākāyā. Jālā katipaya-minitehi āgacchanti.",
