  "d.11cuwtu": "UKKĀ",
  "d.11jyj1n": "Majjhima-piṭṭhivaṃsa-railgun-ādhārita vināsakanāvā, laser-bhamanāyudhehi soḷasa ca ukkākosehi yuttā.",
  "d.11phsqq": "Khelana-pakāsako, yo 100% kittimapaññāya nibbattitaṃ visayaṃ anujānāti, khelanaṃ pakāseti.",
  "d.11zjijr": "Āyudhāni pasāretuṃ saṃharituñ ca sakkā (saṃharitāni paṭicchannāni), nāvā ca dhūmaṃ na nikaḍḍhanti.",
  "d.11zq7hg": "Rūpaṃ: bhautikena ālokitā cālakakoṭṭhā, jātimantā tārakā, valayena yutto vāyumayo mahāgaho, tārā-gaṅgā nebulā-pacchābhūmi ca, yantasikhā gamanadīpā ca; 0.1.0-kīḷā-anubhūti baddhā.",
  "d.12zyt91": "ANVIL, khelana-sūciyā ālaya-rūpaṃ (nāvākāyo 0.3.0 tato pacchā yathā nimmito; mūla-pamāṇaṃ 256 x 128). Khelantare gahitaṃ rūpaṃ, 0.6.1-nibbatti",
  "d.13cb0px": "Nagarassa upari paccatthikā, yantasikhāhi saha (GLASGOW). Khelantare gahitaṃ rūpaṃ, 0.5.3-nibbatti",
