  "d.14s5uo6": "Mahānāvāya yodhanāvāya ca yantasikhā. Khelantare gahitaṃ rūpaṃ, 0.5.3-nibbatti",
  "d.14vqvyw": "ANVIL vivaṭena ālayena. Khelantare gahitaṃ rūpaṃ, 0.6.1-nibbatti",
  "d.14zbb1f": "Khuddakā yodhanāvā THETA-7 ukkāpiṇḍa-khette paccatthika-pakkhassa paharaṇe, tassā āvaraṇa-bubbhaḷaṃ jalati.",
  "d.15oh132": "nibbattiyo ṭhapitā",
  "d.16dme8w": "Thirā laserā nāvāya purato ekasmiṃ lakkha-bindumhi saṅgacchanti.",
