  "d.1hwe7q8": "0.2.2-nibbatti ṭhapitā: sayaṃ-dassana-kamerā, AUTO-vidhi ca yo samīpatamaṃ paccatthikaṃ paharati.",
  "d.1i6l74z": "Copernicus-assa pubbadisāya sopānākāra-bhittiyā upari nīcaṃ uḍḍayanaṃ, suriyatthaṅgamana-chāyārekhāyaṃ, Pathavī upari uccā. Garutā chaṭṭhabhāgo, vāyu natthi: ekekā vakkarekhā khepana-gati.",
  "d.1ib4qda": "Kecid laserānaṃ passe thire bhamanta-minigunā vahanti.",
  "d.1iglk9h": "PERIHELION, 4 SOLAR RADII: Suriyamaṇḍalaṃ suriya-kalaṅkehi unnatiyā ca.",
  "d.1imx84h": "LOW EARTH ORBIT: valaya-ṭhānaṃ suriya-phalakehi Pathaviyā vakkatāya upari.",
  "d.1iuw2c3": "Mutta-dassana parikkama-kamerā, AUTO-vidhi yo samīpatamaṃ paccatthikaṃ paharati, AUTO-gamana-pavatti-antare parivatti, ca mudukaṃ cālakassa paṭidānaṃ.",
  "d.1j7mgjz": "Paccatthika AI-ANVIL yuddhe attano pakkhe khipanti, vāhaka-yānāni ālayaṃ paṭinivattanti, yānāni attano vāhaka-nāvāya āvaraṇa-vaṇṇaṃ dhārenti, railgunā ca sayaṃ mahantā honti.",
  "d.1kbbopx": "Imasmiṃ jālaṭṭhāne jāla-akkharāni",
  "d.1lkmy5i": "bhūmicittāni",
  "d.1lnbgnt": "MAHĀBHĀRAVAHA",
