  "d.1mqb5qu": "Kittimapaññāya kammaṃ naṭṭhānaṃ gaṇakayantakārānaṃ cittakārānañ ca paṭhamo āvaṭṭo Kickstarter-dhanena bhaṭāpīyati.",
