  "d.1nnq5c9": "kammapaṇṇika-vatthūni, EP-001 yāva EP-021: khelana, nimmāṇayanta, nīti, vīmaṃsā-kammañ ca",
  "d.1o102o0": "THRESHER, khelana-sūciyā ālaya-rūpaṃ (nāvākāyo 0.3.0 tato pacchā yathā nimmito; mūla-pamāṇaṃ 256 x 128). Khelantare gahitaṃ rūpaṃ, 0.6.1-nibbatti",
  "d.1o89nc1": "ANVIL vivaṭena ālayena, yuddhavidhi-dassakassa ṭhitarūpaṃ.",
