  "d.1q40xi9": "LEVIATHAN, khelana-sūciyā ālaya-rūpaṃ (nāvākāyo 0.3.0 tato pacchā yathā nimmito; mūla-pamāṇaṃ 256 x 128). Khelantare gahitaṃ rūpaṃ, 0.6.1-nibbatti",
  "d.1qabcqp": "Yathābhūtaṃ kaṭhina-vijjākathā-rūpaṃ, addha-vega-yantavidhi, ukkā ca railgun ca, 12 m tato 1.2 km 16 nāvā, Glasgow-bhūmicittaṃ ca.",
