  "d.1xdakgt": "WARHOUND, khelana-sūciyā ālaya-rūpaṃ (nāvākāyo 0.3.0 tato pacchā yathā nimmito; mūla-pamāṇaṃ 256 x 128). Khelantare gahitaṃ rūpaṃ, 0.6.1-nibbatti",
