  "d.1xktp85": "PAHARAṆA-LAHUNĀVĀ",
  "d.1xw8628": "BRAWLER khelanassa ālaya-sūciyaṃ dassito, 0.6.1-nibbattiyā nāvākāyo, kāḷe pacchābhūmiyaṃ tiṇṇaṃ catutthabhāgānaṃ dassanaṃ.",
  "d.1y1vl1m": "Mandā, kavacitā, bhājanavāhikā nāvā. Cattāro bhamanāyudhā dve ca bindurakkhā-āyudhā luddake nivārenti.",
  "d.1yawpsx": "MINIGUNĀ",
  "d.1yg6jc4": "Āyena aparāpi janā bhaṭāpīyanti, ārambho ca vaḍḍhīyati.",
  "d.1yq2qk7": "THETA-7 ASTEROID FIELD, khelanassa sūciyā khettarūpaṃ. Khelantare gahitaṃ rūpaṃ, 0.6.1-nibbatti",
  "d.1ysusgc": "Mūlena laddhā nāvā puggala-yuddhe kathaṃ yuttā tiṭṭhanti, taṃ ajjāpi ākappīyati.",
  "d.21ryis": "PAHARAṆA-ādesā ekalakkha-samīpatamalakkhānaṃ antare parivattanti.",
  "d.2pbr86": "Majjhima",
  "d.2r8k8j": "UTU-ĀKĀRA",
  "d.2sqinp": "Tisso nāvā yantasikhāhi saha dhūmāyamānassa Glasgow-nagarassa upari, purato cālakassa nāvāya saha.",
  "d.2vomdh": "Khelanalekhāya GPL-paṭhamarūpassa mūlena saha yantasaṃkhātā sadisatā-gavesanā {date0} pavattitā. Tassā phalānaṃ ñāṇīhi vīmaṃsā pavattati. Yaṃ kiñci anukaritaṃ vā anuvattitaṃ vā diṭṭhaṃ, taṃ puna likhitabbaṃ.",
  "d.32ogvm": "Nāsikato pamāṇitā yantasikhā, 240 m ANVIL pāradassī ālaya-dvārehi saha, ubhato NEEDLE-ukkaḍḍhanāni, ekalakkha-samīpatamalakkha-PAHARAṆA-parivatti, AI-ANVIL ca ye pakkhe khipanti.",
  "d.3b0pca": "GAVESAKA",
  "d.3bxw4p": "Janasādhāraṇa-dhanasaṅgaho paṭhamo āvaṭṭo.",
