  "d.4wz1ss": "Ekekassa yuddhassa pubbe (ekakīḷaka-bahukīḷā-saṅgaṇo ca) LOADOUT-dassanaṃ nāvākāya-āvaraṇa-tarehi, āvaraṇa-vaṇṇena, ekekassa āyudhaṭṭhānassa paṅktīhi, ANVIL-ālaya-yānehi ca.",
  "d.5h9ajx": "LASERĀ",
  "d.5zdnfb": "Nibbātaṃ: paṭighāto natthi.",
  "d.61r5q7": "NEEDLE-SAHITO ĀLAYO 10",
  "d.6mw8fz": "Laser-nāḷa-bhamanāyudhānaṃ paṅktiyo, yā AUTO-vidhimhi ārabhanti.",
  "d.6vf32z": "0 (paṭidassana)-nibbatti ṭhapitā: 8 nāvājātiyo, laserā paṅkti-vissajjanañ ca, THETA-7 ukkāpiṇḍa-khettaṃ.",
  "d.6wbq2y": "Suriyamaṇḍalaṃ, bhūmicitta-gavesakassa ṭhitarūpaṃ.",
  "d.709qra": "Pūretuṃ dhāretu, vissajjetuṃ muñcatu. 50 % vā adhikena pūritaṃ muñcato vissajjeti; tato ūnena paṭikkhipati.",
  "d.7a27ds": "Āyudhaṭṭhāna-āsanāni, cha-ukkā-paṅktiyo anubandhaka-kamerāya saha, dviguṇaṃ vegavaḍḍhanaṃ, ANVIL-yamaka-lasarā, ANVIL-ālayo yo 10 mittanāvā NEEDLE khipati, kamerā-kampana-cālanī ca.",
  "d.7xvt5u": "Sabbaṃ BuB-yante kittimapaññāya vikasīyati, Claude Code upayuñjitvā.",
  "d.87vl1g": "Ṭhānika-jāla-bahukīḷā (ekasmiṃ Wi-Fi-jāle kīḷā passatu, saṅgaṇaṃ ṭhapetu vā pavisatu vā, saha ārabhatu; sahakāra-tarangā sabbe-sabbena-yuddhañ ca) tīṇi ca navāni bhūmicittāni: LUNA, EARTH ORBIT, SOL.",
  "d.899luq": "THRESHER khelanassa ālaya-sūciyaṃ dassito, 0.6.1-nibbattiyā nāvākāyo, kāḷe pacchābhūmiyaṃ tiṇṇaṃ catutthabhāgānaṃ dassanaṃ.",
  "d.90i5d3": "Utu-ākāro.",
  "d.99x268": "PATHFINDER khelanassa ālaya-sūciyaṃ dassito, 0.6.1-nibbattiyā nāvākāyo, kāḷe pacchābhūmiyaṃ tiṇṇaṃ catutthabhāgānaṃ dassanaṃ.",
  "d.9kqiam": "Yuddhaṃ rattibhāge ārabhati, kakkhāya sūriyuggamanaṃ tatiye minite āgacchati.",
  "d.9mbw4g": "CHĀYĀREKHĀ",
  "d.9o257g": "0.2.1-nibbatti ṭhapitā: minigun, tathā laser-minigun-ukkānaṃ hatthena sayañ ca lakkhagahaṇaṃ.",
  "d.9rtpka": "MULE khelanassa ālaya-sūciyaṃ dassito, 0.6.1-nibbattiyā nāvākāyo, kāḷe pacchābhūmiyaṃ tiṇṇaṃ catutthabhāgānaṃ dassanaṃ.",
