  "economy.todayLead": "LOADOUT-dassanassa nāvākāya-āvaraṇa-tarāni āvaraṇa-vaṇṇā ca (0.6.0) taṃ uttarīkaraṇaṃ alaṅkārañ ca dassenti, yaṃ dhanavidhānaṃ dātuṃ nimmitaṃ.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Yasmā tassa āyo tesaṃ bhatiyā atthāya. Khelanaṃ sabbaso kittimapaññāya katvā ārabhati, yathā tadā vijjeyya; tato bhatiyā cittakārā kittimapaññāya kammaṃ nāmena sammānitā paṭisthāpenti.",
