  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Pañhā",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Na tāva. Ekasmiṃ jāle LAN-bahukīḷā ajja pavattati (0.2.0 paṭṭhāya); jāla-kīḷā na nimmitā.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Paṭhamarūpaṃ vivaṭākarassa Quake III Arena yantassa (GPL) upari nimmitaṃ, Elite Dangerous-nāvā pakāsakā. Dutiye divase khelanalekhā BuB-yantaṃ āruḷhā, Claude Code-ena likhitaṃ navaṃ yantaṃ; khelana-khaṇḍāni paṭhamarūpato āgantvā nāmaṃ parivattesuṃ. 0.3.0-nibbattiyā sabbāsaṃ 16 nāvājātīnaṃ navā nāvākāyā dinnā. Anuññāpatti-anupālana-vīmaṃsā pariccheti: kiṃ nu kiñci lekhāya GPL-mūlato ajjāpi nibbattaṃ, ādimā nāvārūpā ca tesaṃ pakāsakānaṃ ativiya samīpā ti. Yantasaṃkhātā sadisatā-gavesanā <0/> GPL-paṭhamarūpassa mūlena saha lekhaṃ tulayi, tassā phalānaṃ ñāṇīhi vīmaṃsā pavattati. Yaṃ kiñci nibbattaṃ, taṃ puna likhitabbaṃ pi puna racitabbaṃ pi. Vīmaṃsā niṭṭhāpanā yāva, ‘natthī’ ti uttaraṃ na vadāma.",
  "faq.questions": "Pañhā",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Nāvā, cittāni, paṭisaṃvādamukhañ ca aññañ ca, yathā āyo anujānāti. <0>Imasmiṃ paṇṇe lekhā<\/0> ekekaṃ aṅgaṃ vadati, ekekañ ca paṭisthāpanaṃ tassa cittakārañ ca dassessati.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Nāvā uttarīkaraṇāni ca kīḷantena labhitabbāni vā kiṇitabbāni vā ti āyojitāni. Mūlena laddhā nāvā puggala-yuddhe kathaṃ yuttā tiṭṭhanti, taṃ ajjāpi ākappīyati.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Idaṃ āyojanaṃ: mūlaṃ vinā kīḷanīyaṃ, icchāya khelana-kahāpaṇaṃ alaṅkārā ca. Na tāva nimmitaṃ.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Kassaci kammaṃ anukataṃ kiṃ?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Kadā nikkhamissati, kismiñ ca?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Kataraṃ aṅgaṃ janā paṭisthāpessanti, kathañ ca jānissāmi?",
