  "faq.willPayWin": "Dhanena jayo bhavissati kiṃ?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Nikkhamana-kālo mūlañ ca na tāva atthi.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude Claude Code ca Anthropic, PBC-assa vāṇijalañchanāni. Unreal Engine Epic Games ca Epic Games, Inc.-assa vāṇijalañchanāni. Blender Blender Foundation-assa vāṇijalañchanaṃ. Quake III Arena Elite Dangerous ca tesaṃ tesaṃ sāmīnaṃ vāṇijalañchanāni. Sabbāni nāmāni tesaṃ sāmīnaṃ, uddiṭṭha-bhaṇḍāni eva sañjānituṃ upayuttāni. Orion-81 tesu kenaci saha na sambaddho, na tehi puṭṭho vā anumodito vā.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Patthanāmattaṃ. Bhāgidāro vā sambandho vā anumodanā vā natthi.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Vāhini āgamissati",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "YouTube-e vikasa-lekhā",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Kickstarter anugacchatu",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Anāgatā sahāyā?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Anugāmino natthi. Kukki natthi. Paṭidassana-jālaṭṭhānaṃ. Sabbaṃ saccaṃ yojanāya abhilekhāgāre anukkamena sijjhati; idha kiñci pūjā vā paṭiññā vā natthi.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Na tāva pavattaṃ",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Ekaṃ vatthu vivaṭaṃ yeva: GPL-paṭhamarūpato āgatassa khelanalekhāya <0>anuññāpatti-vīmaṃsā<\/0>. Yantasaṃkhātā sadisatā-gavesanā paṭhamarūpassa mūlena saha lekhaṃ <1/> tulayi, tassā phalānaṃ ñāṇīhi vīmaṃsā pavattati.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 sabbaso kittimapaññāya nibbattitaṃ vatthu.<\/0> Orion-81-assa attano yantalekhā Claude Code-ena ādikattunā disāpitā; nāvā, bhūmicittāni, phassacittāni, saddā ca tehi yantehi nibbattā ye Claude Code-ena likhitā. Yāni vivaṭākara-pothakāgārāni upayuñjati, tāni <1>‘Na AI-katā’<\/1> ti nāmena likhitāni.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Jālaṭṭhāna-pādaṃ",
  "hero.behindThisPlate": "Imassa phalakassa pacchato: ORION-1 khelantare patimā, 0.6.1-nibbattito, tava jāladassake sajīvaṃ dassitā (jāle upayogāya parivattitā, phassacittaṃ 512 px-ni khuddakaṃ katvā).",
