  "meta.description": "Orion-81 sabbaso kittimapaññāya katā yathābhūtā avakāsayuddhakīḷā, yassā āyena kittimapaññāya kammaṃ naṭṭhā cittakārā gaṇakayantakārā ca bhaṭāpetuṃ sakkā. Ito paṭṭhāya nimmitā nāvā, bhūmicittāni, āyudhāni ca gavesatha.",
