  "mission.gameStartsOut": "Khelanaṃ ādimhi 100 % kittimapaññāya nibbattitaṃ hoti. Yathā yathā dhanaṃ labhati, tathā tathā cittakāre bhaṭāpema, ye kittimapaññāya katā nāvā, cittāni, paṭisaṃvādamukhāni ca ekekaṃ katvā paṭisthāpessanti, nāmena sammānitā; gaṇakayantakāre ca, ye kittimapaññā-sahāyena nimmāṇaṃ pavisanti. Orion-81 evarūpānaṃ bahūnaṃ vatthūnaṃ paṭhamaṃ bhavituṃ icchitaṃ. Lakkhaṃ kittimapaññaṃ upayuñjitvā tena abhibhūtānaṃ janānaṃ kiñci hitaṃ kātuṃ.",
