  "why.anthropic": "Anthropic-atthāya",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic": "<0>Anthropic-assa Economic Index (<1/>)<\/0> dassati: ādi-kammakārā attano kammassa bahutamaṃ bhāgaṃ kittimapaññāya kātabbaṃ passanti.",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic2": "<0>Anthropic-assa economic policy framework (<1/>)<\/0> vyāpāre yācati: janaṃ puna sikkhāpetuṃ aññattha niyojetuñ ca, chaḍḍetuṃ na.",
  "why.anthropicSReview": "<0>Anthropic-assa retraining evidence vīmaṃsā (<1/>)<\/0> dasseti: niyojaka-sambandhā, khetta-visesā kammasālā uttamaṃ phalanti.",
  "why.askSimpleFive": "Yācanā sarala: ārambhe pañca Claude āsanāni. Yadi ādikattā tāni paṭibalehi ussāhehi ca janehi pūreti, mayaṃ dassessāma kathaṃ kittimapaññā sucetanāya sundaraṃ kiñci nimminituṃ upayuñjīyati.",
  "why.context": "Pasaṅgo",
  "why.designersEngineers": "Cittakārānaṃ yantakārānañ ca atthāya",
  "why.everyItemBelow": "Heṭṭhā ekekaṃ vatthu āyojanaṃ vā ghosetabbaṃ vā yeva. Idha kiñci na sammataṃ, kiñci pamāṇaṃ na paṭijānīyati.",
  "why.founderWentFrom": "Eko ādikattā paṭhamarūpato 0.6.1 yāva <0/> divasesu pāpuṇi. Cintetu paṭibalā pañcannaṃ gaṇo kiṃ kātuṃ sakkuṇeyya.",
  "why.fromAnthropic": "Anthropic-to",
  "why.fromBackers": "Upatthambhakehi",
  "why.fullyDisclosedAi": "Sabbaso pākaṭaṃ kittimapaññā-katā kīḷā, uddeso yaṃ kīḷakā sodhetuṃ sakkonti, Unreal Engine 5-aṃ gamanaṃ āyojitaṃ (maggacittassa avatthā 3).",
  "why.fullyDocumentedExample": "Yantato khelanaṃ yāva sampuṇṇa-lekhitaṃ kriyāyutta-nimmāṇassa udāharaṇaṃ (abhilekhāgāraṃ, kammapaṇṇikaṃ, ekekā ṭhapitā nibbatti ca rakkhitā), ca kittimapaññāya lābhehi tena nīharitānaṃ janānaṃ bhatiṃ dātuṃ ekassa upāyassa khuddakā vyāvahārikā parikkhā.",
  "why.fundingGoalAnnounced": "Dhana-lakkhaṃ: pacchā ghosīyissati.",
  "why.kickstarterRoadmapPhase": "Kickstarter (maggacittassa avatthā 5) paṭhamo janasādhāraṇa-dhanasaṅgaho. Tassa dhanaṃ kittimapaññāya kammaṃ naṭṭhānaṃ paṭhamānaṃ vikāsakānaṃ cittakārānañ ca bhatiyā atthāya (avatthā 6), ye pacchā kittimapaññā-katāni vatthūni ekekaṃ paṭisthāpenti. <0>Paṭhamo āvaṭṭo kiṃ kiṃ mūlaṃ deti, kiccā kiccā: pacchā ghosīyissati.<\/0>",
  "why.linksContextOnly": "Yojanā pasaṅgāya eva, anumodanaṃ na dīpenti.",
  "why.n06WhyMatters": "06 · Kasmā mahatī",
  "why.orion81Tests": "Orion-81 tassa vicārassa ekaṃ khuddakaṃ rūpaṃ parikkhati. Idaṃ āyojanaṃ, bhatiyo na tāva.",
  "why.plannedPaidCredited": "Āyojitaṃ: bhatiyā nāmena sammānitaṃ kammaṃ kittimapaññā-katāni vatthūni ekekaṃ paṭisthāpentaṃ, yathā āyo anujānāti.",
  "why.publishersEngineMakers": "Pakāsakānaṃ yantakārānañ ca atthāya",
  "why.routesThatExist": "Anthropic-assa janasādhāraṇesu paṭipadāsu yā maggā vijjanti, tesu Claude for Startups (upayogakahāpaṇā Applied AI kammasālā-kālā ca) Claude Founder House ca ghaṭanāyo santi. Orion-81 kittimapaññāya-dhanena puna-bhaṭanaṃ ajjhayantānaṃ gavesakānaṃ khettaṭṭhānaṃ pi bhaveyya. Sammati vā anumodanā vā natthi.",
